<title>USA: Lyondell-Citgo restarts unit at Houston refinery.</title>
<headline>Lyondell-Citgo restarts unit at Houston refinery.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyondell-Citgo Refining Co said over the weekend it restarted its 95,000 barrel per day catalytic cracking unit at its 265,000 bpd refinery in Houston.</p>
<p>The unit was closed for seasonal maintenance several weeks ago, a spokeswoman for the refinery said.</p>
<p>Lyondell-Citgo is a joint venture between Lyondell Petrochemical Co and Citgo Petroleum Corp. Citgo is a unit of Petroleos de Venezuela.</p>
</text>
